  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織……もしかしてなんだけど、\r\n悩みごとでもあったりするか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003040010,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……え",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200304/1002003040010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……最近、何か考え込んでること多いなって、\r\nちょっと気になってな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織は、必要なことだったらちゃんと話してくれる\r\nだから、俺が色々聞くべきじゃないのかもしれないけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……俺にできることがあるなら、\r\nなんでもしたいって思ってる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003040020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "えっと……………………",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200304/1002003040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──無理に全部話してくれとは言わない\r\nだから、差し支えなければ、ひとつだけ教えてほしくて……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003040030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200304/1002003040030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003040040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……はい、答えられることなら",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200304/1002003040040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとう……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その、さ\r\n最近ずっと考えてるのは、アイドルのことか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003040050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200304/1002003040050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003040060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "アイドルのこと、です",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200304/1002003040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……よかった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003040070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……え？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200304/1002003040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それなら、俺にも少しは手伝えるかもしれないからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003040080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いえ、そんな",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200304/1002003040080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003040090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "詳しいことを話していないのに、\r\n何かしてもらうなんて都合がよすぎます",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200304/1002003040090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことないぞ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺にも、灯織が元気にアイドルをやってくれるっていう\r\nいいことがあるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003040100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それは…………",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim4": "eye_front",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200304/1002003040100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003040110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "その、すみません……\r\n今、ちゃんとできていないですよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200304/1002003040110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "違うよ、灯織\r\n『元気に』っていうのは『ちゃんと』ってことじゃない",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織は灯織の思うように、\r\nアイドルとして輝いてほしいんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だからさ……\r\n俺からの提案、聞いてくれるか",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "灯織のステージを\r\n見てみよう",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "アイドルの研究をしよう",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "現場に行こう",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003040120,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それは……その……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200304/1002003040120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003040130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それだと、ダメかもしれません……\r\n今の私には……──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200304/1002003040130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうかな、きっと役に立つよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織のステージを見たら、\r\n次はアイドルのステージを見にいくんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1002003040140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "アイドルの……？\r\n２８３プロのみんなのですか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100200304/1002003040140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、全然関係ないユニットがいいと思うんだ\r\nそうだな……今日すぐ行けるところで……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0272",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
